{"id":"14e11c6d19d5648b","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-representable.md","title":"Representable","display":"df-representable — Representable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-representable","aliases":["88-df-representable"],"display":"df-representable — Representable","depends_on":["[[88-df-theory]]","[[88-df-formula]]","[[88-df-provable]]","[[88-df-numeral]]","[[88-df-free-variable]]","[[88-df-substitution]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-representable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-representable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-representable — Representable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" href=\"?note=b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" title=\"88-df-provable\">88-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a72f024d8daeb569\" href=\"?note=a72f024d8daeb569\" title=\"88-df-substitution\">88-df-substitution</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (formal theory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"def3025c6c81c740\" href=\"?note=def3025c6c81c740\" title=\"88-df-theory\">88-df-theory</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (candidate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>-ary relation)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{R}\">\\(\\mathcal{R}\\)</span> (inference-rule parameter for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathcal R}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathcal R}\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" href=\"?note=b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" title=\"88-df-provable\">88-df-provable</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}_S(\\mathcal R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}_S(\\mathcal R)\\)</span> (proof-rule predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RepBy}_{T,\\mathcal R}(P,\\varphi;x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\">\\(\\mathrm{RepBy}_{T,\\mathcal R}(P,\\varphi;x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\)</span> (representation-by predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_{T,\\mathcal R}(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_{T,\\mathcal R}(P)\\)</span> (representability predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为候选数词签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a> 使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_S(n)\">\\(\\nu_S(n)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_1,\\ldots,x_k\">\\(x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\)</span> 为候选变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[\\nu_S(n_1)/x_1]\\cdots[\\nu_S(n_k)/x_k]\">\\(\\varphi[\\nu_S(n_1)/x_1]\\cdots[\\nu_S(n_k)/x_k]\\)</span> 表示依次代入闭项的公式\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[\\nu_S(n_1)/x_1]\\cdots[\\nu_S(n_k)/x_k]\">\\(\\varphi[\\nu_S(n_1)/x_1]\\cdots[\\nu_S(n_k)/x_k]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 时它就是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>。这里不是把公式当作未定义的数值函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\vec n,m)\">\\((\\vec n,m)\\)</span> 在关系位置表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n_1,\\ldots,n_k,m)\">\\((n_1,\\ldots,n_k,m)\\)</span> 的扁平元组。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_{T,\\mathcal R}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_{T,\\mathcal R}\\)</span> 的每次调用均使用该关系实际声明的元数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a> 的一元数词签名谓词，其常量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 与一元函数符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf s\">\\(\\mathsf s\\)</span> 与本条数词一致。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RepBy}_{T,\\mathcal R}(P,\\varphi;x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\n\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_S(\\mathcal R)\n\\land(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^k\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(i\\neq j\\to x_i\\neq x_j)\n\\land P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\n\\land\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)=\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}\n\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb{N}^k\\;\n\\Bigl(\n(\\vec n\\in P\\to T\\vdash_{\\mathcal{R}}\\varphi[\\nu_S(n_1)/x_1]\\cdots[\\nu_S(n_k)/x_k])\n\\land\n(\\vec n\\notin P\\to T\\vdash_{\\mathcal{R}}\\neg\\varphi[\\nu_S(n_1)/x_1]\\cdots[\\nu_S(n_k)/x_k])\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RepBy}_{T,\\mathcal R}(P,\\varphi;x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NumeralSignature}(S)\n\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_S(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Rule}_S(\\mathcal R)\n\\land(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S^k\n\\land\\forall i,j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(i\\neq j\\to x_i\\neq x_j)\n\\land P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\n\\land\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)=\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\}\n\\land\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb{N}^k\\;\n\\Bigl(\n(\\vec n\\in P\\to T\\vdash_{\\mathcal{R}}\\varphi[\\nu_S(n_1)/x_1]\\cdots[\\nu_S(n_k)/x_k])\n\\land\n(\\vec n\\notin P\\to T\\vdash_{\\mathcal{R}}\\neg\\varphi[\\nu_S(n_1)/x_1]\\cdots[\\nu_S(n_k)/x_k])\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Rep}_{T,\\mathcal R}(P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\n\\exists x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\mathrm{RepBy}_{T,\\mathcal R}(P,\\varphi;x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Rep}_{T,\\mathcal R}(P)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\n\\exists x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\n\\mathrm{RepBy}_{T,\\mathcal R}(P,\\varphi;x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_{T,\\mathcal{R}}(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_{T,\\mathcal{R}}(P)\\)</span> : 关系<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>在理论<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>及推理规则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathcal R\\)</span>下可表示</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{n}\">\\(\\bar{n}\\)</span> : 数字符号 (numeral, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" href=\"?note=69c0e9e2e8f423a6\" title=\"88-df-numeral\">88-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n<li>可表示性是证明不完备性定理的关键概念</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RepBy}\">\\(\\mathrm{RepBy}\\)</span>保留具体见证公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}\\)</span>再量化掉该见证。</li>\n<li>这里定义的是强（numeralwise）可表示性：成员与非成员两侧都要求理论证明；\n仅要求成员侧时应另称弱可表示性。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"def3025c6c81c740","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"69c0e9e2e8f423a6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"b642ab331635c77d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"a72f024d8daeb569","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor"